HOTKEYS:

    Global:
        
        - TAB    =>   Toggle Camera Mode

        - F      =>   Toggle Sharpen Filter 
        - G      =>   Toggle Blur Filter 
        - J      =>   Toggle Scanline Filter 

        - H      =>   Toggle HUD (to be implemented)
        - C      =>   Toggle Chroma-Keying Display (to be implemented)

        - O      =>   Hide/Show Other Cars (to be implemented)
        - B      =>   Hide/Show Bezier-curve (to be implemented)


    First Person:

        - Z/W    =>   Fast forward
        - S      =>   Slow Down
        - SHIFT  =>   Reverse
        - SPACE  =>   Brake


    Free Cam:

        - Z/W    =>   Move Forward
        - S      =>   Move Backward
        - Q/D    =>   Move Left and Right
        - SHIFT  =>   Go Down (Relative, not global down)
        - SHIFT  =>   Go Up (Relative, not global up)

        - Clicking the stack of tires next to 
          the entrance of the pitstop enters pitstop mode



SECRET SETTING HOTKEY (ssssshhhhhh)

    - L     =>      toggle legacy driving mode (varying speed)




